OL,12,     FPetroc Trelawny presents live
OL,13,     Fmusic from violinist Viktoria
OL,14,     FMullova and pianist Alasdair
OL,15,     FBeatson, and speaks to baritone
OL,16,     FChristian Gerhaher about singing
OL,17,     Fin Parsifal.
